    "The native bob replaces the original flat cap with a continuous rounded pink crown and readable layered locks. Front, E/W profiles and rear are coherent through stand, walk, both seated variants, eating, transitions and reactions. The radial crown sweep is a native design interpretation, not a reference for unseen target views.",
