    "Broad warm highlights and softer midtones give the model volume without clipping away pink/yellow detail. Opposite facings remain similarly readable, with no preferred horizontal cast-light direction or baked ground shadow. Light, gray and dark presentations show clean transparent edges without material halo/seam defects.",
    "All576 ordered native frames were visually inspected through36 hash-bound three-background sheets whose1728 frame presentations independently equal the submitted native pixels at logical size. All48 atlas cells/APNG frame sequences independently match those raw frames. Actual12fps APNG sources were loaded in Chrome in six eight-clip groups and examined at distinct playback snapshots, including the transitions and both runtime variants.",
    "Held cucumber and salmon track the preserved meal motion and sit naturally against the front/side body in eating/stool contexts; rear body occlusion is coherent. The empty runtime waiting clip remains empty. No food swimming, new per-view fitting, floating seat/sole contact, disconnected hand/cuff, exposed hair gap, black overlap patch or canvas clipping was found.",
    "The sealed native main/runtime projects were independently reopened and evaluated through all576 poses. Native body forms are weighted editable geometry with Principled/AO surface graphs; the only active owned raster is the correctly identified exact canonical food plane. The61 body-mesh content signatures, including normals, weights, UVs, material graphs and modifiers, match between main and runtime.",
    "Independent preserved-layer native replay controls substantiate the supplied capture content. Four of six controls are exact decodedRGBA; two differ by1LSB in one color channel at one pixel. This agrees with the scoped renderer-rounding evidence and is not a claim of universal PNG file-byte determinism."
